OL,3,GNEWSABudget hopes as hospitality faces
OL,4,A'uphill battle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTourism and hospitality leaders have
OL,7,Fwarned the government any further
OL,8,Ftaxation or financial pressures in the
OL,9,Fupcoming Budget would "hinder growth".
OL,11,FKatie Warren, the chair of the Cornwall
OL,12,FVisitors Alliance, said the sector was
OL,13,Fwatching "with absolutely bated
OL,14,Fbreath".
OL,16,FMany businesses in Devon and Cornwall
OL,17,Fhave also called for the Chancellor
OL,18,FJohn Healey to reverse last year's
OL,19,Fchanges to National Insurance
OL,20,Fcontributions.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
